 "integration": {
  "summary": "Set 9802 = STD MODBUS and the group 53 link settings, then 5305 = ABB DRV FULL, point 1001 EXT1 COMMANDS and 1103 REF1 SELECT at COMM, write the control word and REF1 at 40001/40002 and poll the status word plus 0103/0104 at 40103/40104.",
  "minimum_registers": [
   {
    "table": "holding_register",
    "address": 0,
    "why": "Control word: start/stop/reset"
   },
   {
    "table": "holding_register",
    "address": 1,
    "why": "REF1 frequency setpoint (20000 = 1105)"
   },
   {
    "table": "holding_register",
    "address": 3,
    "why": "Status word: ready/running/fault/remote"
   },
   {
    "table": "holding_register",
    "address": 102,
    "why": "0103 Output frequency, 0.1 Hz"
   },
   {
    "table": "holding_register",
    "address": 103,
    "why": "0104 Motor current, 0.1 A"
   },
   {
    "table": "holding_register",
    "address": 106,
    "why": "0107 DC bus voltage"
   },
   {
    "table": "holding_register",
    "address": 400,
    "why": "0401 Last fault code"
   },
   {
    "table": "holding_register",
    "address": 304,
    "why": "0305 Fault word 1"
   }
  ],
  "enable": "Set 1611 PARAMETER VIEW = LONG VIEW, then 9802 COMM PROT SEL = STD MODBUS (EIA-485 on terminals 23-26) or MODBUS RS232 (panel connector). Set 5302 station ID, 5303 baud, 5304 parity and 5305 profile. For control set 1001 EXT1 COMMANDS = COMM (1002 for EXT2), 1103 REF1 SELECT = COMM, and optionally 1102, 1601 RUN ENABLE and 1604 FAULT RESET SEL = COMM. Save fieldbus parameter writes with 1607 PARAM SAVE.",
  "watchdog": "3018 COMM FAULT FUNC (NOT SEL default / FAULT / CONST SP 7 / LAST SPEED) after the delay in 3019 COMM FAULT TIME (default 3.0 s, 0.1 s steps). FAULT trips SERIAL 1 ERR and coasts; the other two raise alarm IO COMM and keep running.",
  "quirks": [
   "Register 4xxxx is wire address xxxx - 1 (40001 = 0); parameter NNNN is register 4NNNN.",
   "Everything is 16-bit; there is no word order to worry about.",
   "Start per the state diagram (p. 306): write 0x0476 (ready to switch on), then 0x0477 once status bit 0 is 1 (ready to operate), then 0x047F to run; bits 4 and 10 in these values only matter with ABB DRV FULL. Control word bit 3 also needs the run enable (1601). Fault reset is a 0->1 edge on bit 7 with 1604 = COMM.",
   "Parameter writes over Modbus are volatile until 1607 PARAM SAVE is used."
  ],
  "setup": [
   "Parameter-list defaults: station 1, 9.6 kbit/s, 8 data bits, no parity, 1 stop bit.",
   "The RS-232 option uses the control panel connector."
  ],
  "gotchas": [
   "Reading or writing a register that is not a parameter returns exception 02; writing a read-only parameter, an out-of-range value, or a parameter while started returns exception 03.",
   "With the default ABB DRV LIM profile, control word bits 4 and 10 are ignored."
  ]
 },
